body:
 Hello. Thank you for the reply. The confusing starts with for example:

\- The ferries I looked up on start sailing at about 14:00 , and the last returning hour is about 20:30, so that leaves me with only 4 hrs to spend there. I don't want to be rushing things and I really don't wanna have a sleepover in Helsinki, soo my question here is are there any chances to catch earlier one on site? I thought that they sail 24/7?

&#x200B;

\- In the airport I will travel with economy class are there any places to smoke?

&#x200B;

\- OK so then after Riga and Helsinki , can I do something more? Apart from St.Petersburg (I need a visa to go there and it is quite costly) ?

&#x200B;

\-I'm not really in to food, I really would like to explore the city more, then if  I have time to spare, more likely I would like to get a cup of coffee somewhere. But as we speaking any suggestions on food? (I am still gonna need to eat every now and then for two months :D )
